<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Avgold's Harties Q2 gold sold rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Avgold's Harties Q2 gold sold rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Capital expenditure		   12.91    vs   6.41</p>
<p>    Gold sold (kg)			  5,143    vs   5,090</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	   1,220,000    vs   1,154,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			   4.22    vs   4.41</p>
<p>    Cash cost (rand/kg)		  51,742    vs   49,812</p>
<p>    Total cost (rand/kg)		 58,405    vs   53,995</p>
<p>Full name: Hartebeestfontein division of Avgold Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
